            "review_title": "Review at Samurai Cafe Saigon",
            "review_text": "catfbb\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nUnique Japanese Home-made Style Cafe 　日本スタイルの 静かなカフェ\nFeb 2017 • Business\nUnique Japanese Homemade cafe, good for cafe work because of Japanese Home-made dishes, reasonable price Italian & Vietnam coffee & tea with dessert, and silent & peace circumstance.\n\n1. Unique and Reasonable Drink & Food\nThe menu is not only Macha or Vientnam coffee, Italian & American also.\nAs well Japanese Home-made taste, curry rice, Tako-rice, Hiyashi noodle...\n\n2. Silent & pease place\nThis cafe is settled 30m far from Le Thanh Ton street to escape from the loud. Of course FreeWiFi and Bright room is good for your work.\n\n3. Education and network Hub\nThis cafe has over 800 books (Japanese Picture book, Famous Business books(in En or Jp) , a bit nobel & manga...)\nNow Free On-line Education Service \"schoo\" is available. \n\nThis is one of the everyday cafe for your PC work.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 4, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
