            "review_title": "Review at Samurai Cafe Saigon",
            "review_text": "hotforest\nCrouch End, United Kingdom207 contributions\n0\nA curry restaurant that never has curry...\nJun 2016 • Solo\nI've visited Samurai twice now at lunch time, usually 1pm, and they have no curry. It's not very difficult to plan ahead, the one thing you have on your menu and you don't have it. I guess it is too much to expect Vietnamese to think about things in advance.\n\nReally disappointed because it looks like quite a cute little restaurant.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 21, 2016",
