            "review_title": "Review at Samurai Cafe Saigon",
            "review_text": "Mizuki Mori\n1 contribution\n0\nThe atmosphere and the staff are good!\nApr 2016 • Business\nThe Samurai Cafe is in a back alley. The atmosphere is nice. I think everyone can stay all day long. \nYou can have smoothies, mattcha flavor drink,Vietnam coffee and good dishes. There are \"Yakisoba(Japanese style flied noodle)\",Japanese style curry,\nspaghetti and good mattcha cheese cake etc...\nIF you can read Japanese, you will enjoy Japanese magazines,comics and books!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 15, 2016",
